
*** LIST OF HELPFUL COMMANDS FOR UUF ACTIVITIES ***

agentnode        shows tail of agent log
autofallback     perfroms autofallback tc during feature tests
benchmark        downloads soft from burak and checks time to complete this operation
bufu             runs yaft with FPGA update
build            checks build on active and passive partition
burak            mounts burak for general agent purposes in .ute_ca
buraki           opens burak location in explorer
burako           mounts pseudo-burak (local mirror) in Oulu VM
buraku           mounts user friendly burak on desktop
buuf             opens UUF directory in explorer
caute            mounts burak after running UTECA agent
cebula           opens onion in chrome
choinka          draws christmas tree
cleanup          puts default swconfig, restores netboot, clears reset counters, clears fallback cause
cleanup1         cleanup for .1
cleanup129       cleanup for .129
config           opens testline_configuration with testline catalog deintegrate. Deintegrates BTS from NA lab
dej              Runs UTECA agent. usage with argument to build number. Before using dej run command uteca. When script is finished run caute
dev              allows to pull your own branch to robotws
dnsoff           turns off dnsmasq for netboot activities
dnson            turns on dnsmasq for netboot activities
dnsstat          checks the status of dnsmasq
envsetup         updates Quality of Life scripts to newest version
envupdate        updates Quality of Life scripts to newest version
fallback         initiates fallback to passive partition CAUSES RESET
hai              hai:)
hardreset        toggles the power to system modules
helpplx          shows this help message
iledupek         checks how many loops were performed in e2e
ilelupek         checks how many loops were performed in e2e
init             opens init.py file of BTS
ktoryreset       checks how many reset were performed
mountfs3         mounts recovery partition in bts
nafeature        alias for activate NETACT_FEATURE.robot, add TC number if you want to perform specific TC
netact           checks connections between provided VM and NetAct lab
netactb          checks connection between VM and labs.
nlab             opens netact lab website, default open srnclab2001, add netact lab number after alias to open different netact lab website
nokurwcojest     runs yaft with FPGA update
ocelot           unlocks the ssh access by modifying swconfig
pass             prints a well known password for convinience
ping1            opens ping to .1
ping119          opens ping to .119
ping129          opens ping to .129
ping2            opens ping to .129, yes 129 not 2
ping7            opens ping to .7
poweroffall      powers down all modules
poweroffsm       powers down SMs
poweroffrm       powers down RMs
poweronall       powers up all modules
poweronrm        powers up RMs
poweronsm        powers on SMs
predator         opens terminator in VMs
pyaft            yaft scrip, usage with argument to build number
pyaft1           yaft scrip, usage with argument to build number, aims .1 address
pyaft129         yaft scrip, usage with argument to build number, aims .129 address
rescik           runs reset, usage with arguments to build number and amount
rebootall        power cycles all modules
release          releases the VM reservation - you will loose all unsaved data
riper            runs agent repair, you can put short build name f.e. "21B" and it will take latest available build from burak, or put entire build name
rota             mounts rota on desktop
quicklaunch      adds quicklaunch icons bar near start menu
sheriff	         semi-automatic script to unlock BTS with port security enabled, parametrized with last octet of ip
sheriff1         sherriff which strikes .1 address
sheriff129       sherriff which strikes .129 address
snake            asks snake to do something
sofcik           opens artifactory to download software
sshenb           opens ssh session to .129 and passes the password
sshenb1          opens ssh session to .1 and passes the password
sshenb119        opens ssh session to .119 and passes the password
sshenb7          opens ssh session to .7 and passes the password
stabi            shows stabi runner progress
startloop        starts e2e loops
superfallback    initiates superfallback to factory partition (Airscale only) CAUSES RESET
suchybut         dryrun of ubut downgrade. Shows which firmware would it downgrade. Useful for version checking
switchpart       changes partition to active. Very useful to fix FSMF
swfallbacktimer  starts autofallback with non-default fallback timer. Available from 23R4
tables           opens tables.py in gedit
ubut             performs uboot downgrade
uteca            unmount burak before running UTECA agent
wow              calls piesel
www              opens up WebEM in chrome in certificate safe mode - no more pesky reminders about security
www2             opens up WebEM for secondary node in chrome in certificate safe mode - no more pesky reminders about security
yafduo           runs yaft with FPGA update
yafud            yaft scrip, usage with argument to build number, script detects if it is FSM3 or Airscale



